uga?","a":"The classic overland from Marrakech (3-6 days) - over the Tizi n''Tichka pass to Ait Benhaddou, through the Dades and Todra gorges, then a camel trek into the dunes to your camp. Fez is the shorter alternative bookend.","source":"kimkim.com","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"What are the luxury desert camps like?","a":"En-suite dome tents with real beds and bathrooms, hosted dining, camel treks and stargazing - the Sahara without roughing it. Rates run about EUR290-460/night at Erg Chebbi and around GBP320 at Erg Chigaga''s Nubia camp.","source":"ergchebbicamp.com","si_tag":"ultra"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Merzouga & the Sahara Guide: Erg Chebbi Dunes, Luxury Camps & the Overland Route","meta_description":"Plan the Moroccan Sahara - Erg Chebbi and Erg Chigaga dunes, luxury desert camps, camel treks, and the overland route from Marrakech (Ait Benhaddou, Dades, Todra), best season Oct-Apr, with real safety and timing intel.","slug":"merzouga-morocco","primary_keyword":"Merzouga Sahara Morocco","long_tail":["Erg Chebbi luxury camp","Merzouga camel trek","Marrakech to Sahara tour","Erg Chigaga","best time Moroccan desert","is the Moroccan Sahara safe"],"search_language":"fr","local_keywords":["Merzouga","Erg Chebbi","Sahara","Ait Benhaddou","dunes"],"hreflang":["en","fr","es"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-08-03","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-03","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/morocco","read":"2026-08-20T14:47:38Z","source_updated":"2026-08-19T12:00:36+01:00"}]}},"book