venture","blurb":"the old ridge trail above the harbour","commission":"held","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["adventure"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"primary","culture":"destination","entertainment":"destination","ocean":"destination"},"commission_lane":["none"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is the current advisory for Muscat, and can I book it through TravelWell?","a":"The armed conflict that began 28 February 2026 (U.S./Israeli strikes on Iran; Iranian retaliatory strikes on all six GCC states; the Strait of Hormuz - which Oman borders - closed to commercial shipping; Re-verify the level and flight picture before any travel.","source":"level+conflict supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read of the US Embassy UAE alert 4 Jun 2026 (Oman listed) + State-advisory press; FCDO flagged, not read in this build","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-08-09"},{"q":"How are flights and airspace affected?","a":"Gulf airports are open but subject to short-notice closures; American Airlines cancelled Philadelphia-Doha through the end of 2026 as one regional example, and Oman sits directly on the Strait of Hormuz. Confirm every segment close to departure.","source":"supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-08-09"},{"q":"What would a Muscat trip cover once bookable again?","a":"The Sultan Qaboos Grand Mosque, Mutrah Souq and a Corniche evening, the Royal Opera House, Al Alam Palace with the harbour forts, the National Museum and Bait Al Zubair, Qurum Beach - plus day trips to the Bimmah Sinkhole, Wadi Shab and the Daymaniyat Islands.","source":"en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Muscat (accessed 2026-08-10) + web search 2026-08-10 (Viator/Tripadvisor)","si_tag":"planning","accessed":"2026-08-10"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit Muscat?","a":"October-April is the mild season; summer is very hot, above 40C. Planning-only guidance while the destination is held content-only.","source":"en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Muscat (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"planning","accessed":"2026-08-10"},{"q":"Is there anything specific to know about safety in the city itself?","a":"Beyond the regional conflict and the Hormuz/flight risk, Oman is generally low-crime and hospitable; Re-verify the advisory before acting on anything here.","source":"level supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read; en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Muscat (accessed 2026-08-10)","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-08-10"}],"seo":{"meta_description":"Held content-only.","slug":"muscat-oman","primary_keyword":"Muscat travel advisory 2026","long_tail":["Oman safety 2026","Sultan Qaboos Grand Mosque","Daymaniyat Islands","Wadi Shab"],"search_language":"ar (restated, not machine-translated)","local_keywords":["مسقط","جامع السلطان قابوس","سوق مطرح"],"hreflang":["en","ar"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-08-10","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-10","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/oman","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:57Z","source_updated":"2026-07-22T13:46:33+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"booking_hold":true,"codes":[],"note":"HELD CONTENT-ONLY. Iranian retaliatory strikes on all six GCC states; Strait of Hormuz - which Oman borders - closed; FAST-MOVING: re-verify. CITATION: level+conflict supplied by Strategy Claude from a 2026-08-09 read of the US Embassy UAE alert 4 Jun 2026 (Oman listed) + State-advisory press; FCDO wording for Oman NOT read in this build (required second source - ver