 of the jewel."}],"faq":[{"q":"When should I visit the Tunisian desert?","a":"October to April - sweet spot October-November and March-April (20-30C days). Summer tops 40C and is unsafe; winter nights are cold, so pack layers.","source":"desertroamer.com","si_tag":"globaladv"},{"q":"Can I visit the Star Wars sets?","a":"Yes - the Mos Espa exterior set near Tozeur (Ong Jmal) and the Lars homestead interior (Sidi Driss hotel in Matmata) are still standing and visitable, usually on a 4x4 desert loop.","source":"tunisiatourism.org","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"What are the luxury desert camps like?","a":"En-suite tents with real beds, electricity and gourmet dining, with 4x4 transport and camel trekking - the Sahara in comfort. Luxury multi-day packages run about EUR250-500+.","source":"goworldtravel.com","si_tag":"ultra"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Tozeur & the Tunisian Sahara Guide: Oases, Star Wars Sets & Luxury Camps","meta_description":"Plan the Tunisian Sahara - Tozeur''s oasis and Chott el Jerid, the Mos Espa Star Wars set, Douz camel treks, Ksar Ghilane''s hot spring, Matmata, and luxury desert camps, best season Oct-Apr, with real safety intel.","slug":"tozeur-tunisia","primary_keyword":"Tozeur Tunisia Sahara","long_tail":["Tunisia Star Wars sets","Douz camel trek","Chott el Jerid","Ksar Ghilane hot spring","Matmata","best time Tunisian desert"],"search_language":"ar","local_keywords":["Tozeur","Douz","Sahara","Chott el Jerid","Matmata","Mos Espa"],"hreflang":["en","fr","ar"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-08-03","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-03","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_agai