so","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$1,500-2,500+/night"},{"name":"A private Big-Five + boat + rhino-conservation day","why_ultra":"exclusive-vehicle Big Five game drive + the Lake Ihema boat safari + a behind-the-scenes African Parks conservation visit, privately guided","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"},{"name":"The 3-park luxury Rwanda circuit (Volcanoes + Nyungwe + Akagera)","why_ultra":"gorillas + chimps/canopy walk + the Big-Five savanna, private-guided - and it unlocks the Nov-May 30% gorilla-permit discount","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"}],"source_verified":"2026-08-01","hero":{"query":"Akagera National Park, Rwanda"},"geo":{"lat":-1.65,"lng":30.7},"orbit":[],"orbit_country":["nyungwe-forest-rwanda","volcanoes-national-park-rwanda"]}'::jsonb, 5),
  ('amboseli-kenya', '05A', 'Amboseli National Park', 'Kenya', 'Elephants under Kilimanjaro', 'live', 'verified', 'elephant', 'Kenya — Amboseli / Kilimanjaro views', '{"safari","ultra","romance","adventure","deepdive","culture"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'anchor', '{"key_facts":["Elephants under Kilimanjaro - the most iconic backdrop in safari: 1,600+ free-ranging elephants incl. some of the last Super Tuskers; the best Kilimanjaro (5,896m) views are from Amboseli (clearest at dawn Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb, before ~10am cloud)","Four of the Big Five (elephant, lion, buffalo, leopard) - NO rhino (hunted to local extinction 1970s); pair with Laikipia (Ol Pejeta/Lewa) for rhino","The Amboseli Elephant Research Project (founded 1972 by Cynthia Moss) - the longest wild-elephant study on Earth, 3,500+ individuals, matriarchal society; snowmelt swamps + 400+ birds","KWS fee $70/24-hour (proposed $90 under court review); cost ~$400-850/pp/day comfortable-premium, ~$900-2,000 luxury","Sold via Kenya safari DMCs ~10-16%+ - IATAN/host-gated, CLIA has NO Africa representation; KWS fees non-commissionable pass-through; AMREF Flying Doctors for evac","KES (~129/USD) + M-Pesa but safari quoted USD; eTA required; malaria prophylaxis advised (chloroquine-resistant); YF only if arriving from a risk country"],"safety":{"emergency":"999 / 112 / 911 (reliable in cities, weak remote); Kenya Red Cross ambulance 1199; AMREF Flying Doctors for bush evac","hospital":"Remote - AMREF Flying Doctors (~$40 pp/30d) + travel-medical insurance; nearest referral Nairobi","malaria":"prophylaxis advised (CDC - Amboseli qualifies, chloroquine-resistant); DEET at dusk","yellow_fever":"compulsory only if arriving from a risk country; CDC recommends for most","activity_note":"Free-ranging elephants at close range - keep distance, stay in the vehicle, never between a matriarch and calves; elephants can charge. Malaria the main health risk. Remote - carry AMREF evac + insurance","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/kenya","read":"2026-09-01T16:18:02Z","page_updated":"2026-09-01T12:05:48+01:00","source_country":"kenya","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely","fcdo_zones":[{"name":"Mandera, Wajir and Garissa counties","lvl":4,"note":"The Somalia border counties."},{"name":"Lamu County","lvl":4},{"name":"Tana River","lvl":4},{"name":"Kilifi north of Malindi","lvl":4},{"name":"The northern border areas","lvl":4},{"name":"Eastleigh, Nairobi","lvl":3},{"name":"Kibera, Nairobi","lvl":3}]},"timing":{"peak":"Jun-Oct (dry, clearest Kilimanjaro, wildlife at the marshes) + Jan-Feb (dry, clear mountain)","shoulder":"Nov + Mar (quieter, softer rates)","green":"Apr-May (long rains - lush, quiet, cheapest; mountain often clouded)","booking_lead":"lodges + Kenya-circuit 4-9 mo for Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb (under-Kili luxury sells out); shoulder 2-4 mo; green 1-2 mo","off_season_specials":"Apr-May green-season value; combine Maasai Mara / Tsavo / Laikipia (rhino)","event_peaks":"Jun-Oct + Christmas/NY + Easter; N-Hemisphere summer","fire_date":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb clear-mountain safaris 6-9 mo out; green value by prior Nov-Dec; bundle Amboseli + Laikipia (rhino) to complete the Big Five"},"jewels":[{"name":"Elephants under Kilimanjaro (Super Tuskers)","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~$400-2,000/pp/day","timing":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb; dawn","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the most iconic image in safari — great herds and giant-tusked bulls crossing the dust with the snow-capped 5,896-m peak behind","si":"safari","blurb":"the most iconic image in safari — great herds and giant-tusked bulls crossing the dust with the snow-capped 5,896-m peak behind","when":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb; dawn","commission":"safari DMC 10-16%","wells":["activities","move"],"wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text","si_all":["safari